@startuml state_booking
[*] --> PENDING : hold_seats()\nexpires_at = now + 5 min
PENDING --> PENDING : pay_booking() fails\n(attempt recorded, retry allowed)
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : pay_booking() succeeds / confirm()
PENDING --> CANCELLED : release_hold(), replaced by a new hold,\nor cancel_booking() / cancel()
PENDING --> EXPIRED : deadline passed\n(next request sweeps stale holds) / expire()
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : cancel_booking() before show / cancel() + refund
CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
@enduml
